#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for damaging property by graffiti` `as the accused` `accused under both` EQUALS amount 24000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for damaging property by graffiti` `as the accused` `accused under s 6` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
