-- Each of the nine questions of an affected person's rights (ss 20-23) is asked for each of the four notice values
-- under which I am an affected person (s 20): the notice given to me as owner, as occupier, or as both (the person to
-- whom it was given), and to my occupier while I own (the owner is also an affected person). The notice given to me as
-- owner and occupier is asked in the section on a notice given for graffiti said to be put up without consent, the
-- other three here. Each is also asked for my landlord given the notice while I rent (not an affected person), and for
-- no notice.
--
-- Written reasons and rights (ss 20, 21): to me as owner, or as a tenant, yes; to my tenant while I own, yes (s 20); to
-- my landlord while I rent: no. No notice: does not arise.
